RECONSTRUCTION - this file is NOT the original affich3digit of the EA library.
It was rebuilt on 2026-10-20 by outils/reconstruction.py from the symbol "affich3digit" found in Afficheur8D.bdf.
Three decoders DEC_7SEG (library): E[11..8] -> c (hundreds), E[7..4] -> d (tens), E[3..0] -> u (units).
Outputs [1..7] = segments a..g, active low (0 = segment lit) as on the DE0 board.
See RECONSTRUCTIONS.md for details.
*/
